From d7fe17d4612ecd377eca00906a44df558a22b5cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qcom-toolbox <169756160+qcom-toolbox@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:18:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: common_v2: port the S5K4H5YC and S5K5E3 sensor
 infos from v3

The common_v2 constructors for the SM-T395's sensors were stubs, so the
HAL reported empty static metadata. Port them from common_v3 along with
the YUV size lists and color matrices they reference.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YHmiQGxHgHmd9D8TNUemvH
